     "  \[Bullet]  ", ButtonBox["SpinorExpressionComplexity",
      BaseStyle -> "Link", ButtonData ->
       "paclet:HEPCAT/ref/SpinorExpressionComplexity"]}], "SeeAlso"],
  Cell["Related Guides", "MoreAboutSection"],
  Cell[TextData[{ButtonBox["Identities and Simplification",
      BaseStyle -> "Link", ButtonData ->
       "paclet:HEPCAT/guide/IdentitiesAndSimplification"], "  \[Bullet]  ",
     ButtonBox["HEPCAT: Constructive Amplitudes and Spinor Algebra",
